  "notes": "Contract authored 2026-08-23 during the MDN-shape upgrade of this previously legacy-unassessed page. Inventory derived from the WICG spec's IDL index (quoted verbatim in #syntax) and its processing model; the runtime gate verified in Chromium runtime_enabled_features.json5. The upgrade also corrects a factual error in the earlier revision (it claimed the event fires on individual controls after filling; spec \u00a74.1 dispatches it at the document before the fill) \u2014 the correction is noted visibly in the at-a-glance citation. Member documentation lives in per-member sections on this page; splitting autofillValues/refill into stable child routes is recorded as a follow-up goal. BCD/webstatus have no entry for the event; compat is an interim ChromeStatus/source-derived table labelled as such."
